{"id":"torrey:garments","source":"torrey","name":"Garments","slug":"garments","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Origin of — Ge 3:7,21.","refs":[["Gen",3,7,3,7],["Gen",3,21,3,21]]},{"text":"Raiment. — Ge 28:20; De 8:4.","refs":[["Gen",28,20,28,20],["Deut",8,4,8,4]]},{"text":"Clothes. — Pr 6:27; Eze 16:39.","refs":[["Prov",6,27,6,27],["Ezek",16,39,16,39]]},{"text":"Clothing. — Job 22:6; 31:19.","refs":[["Job",22,6,22,6],["Job",31,19,31,19]]},{"text":"Vesture. — Ge 41:42; Re 19:16.","refs":[["Gen",41,42,41,42],["Rev",19,16,19,16]]},{"text":"Wool. — Pr 27:26; Eze 34:3.","refs":[["Prov",27,26,27,26],["Ezek",34,3,34,3]]},{"text":"Silk. — Pr 31:22.","refs":[["Prov",31,22,31,22]]},{"text":"Linen. — Le 6:10; Es 8:15.","refs":[["Lev",6,10,6,10],["Esth",8,15,8,15]]},{"text":"Camel’s hair. — Mt 3:4.","refs":[["Matt",3,4,3,4]]},{"text":"Skins. — Heb 11:37.","refs":[["Heb",11,37,11,37]]},{"text":"Sackcloth. — 2Sa 3:31; 2Ki 19:1.","refs":[["2Sam",3,31,3,31],["2Kgs",19,1,19,1]]},{"text":"Not to be made of mixed materials — De 22:11.","refs":[["Deut",22,11,22,11]]},{"text":"Of the sexes, not to be interchanged — De 22:5.","refs":[["Deut",22,5,22,5]]},{"text":"White. — Ec 9:8.","refs":[["Eccl",9,8,9,8]]},{"text":"Blue. — Eze 23:6.","refs":[["Ezek",23,6,23,6]]},{"text":"Purple. — Eze 7:27; Lu 16:19.","refs":[["Ezek",7,27,7,27],["Luke",16,19,16,19]]},{"text":"Scarlet. — 2Sa 1:24; Da 5:7.","refs":[["2Sam",1,24,1,24],["Dan",5,7,5,7]]},{"text":"Different colours. — Ge 37:3; 2Sa 13:18.","refs":[["Gen",37,3,37,3],["2Sam",13,18,13,18]]},{"text":"Were often fringed and bordered — Nu 15:38; De 22:12.","refs":[["Num",15,38,15,38],["Deut",22,12,22,12]]},{"text":"Scribes and Pharisees condemned for making broad the borders of — Mt 23:5.","refs":[["Matt",23,5,23,5]]},{"text":"Worn long and flowing — Lu 20:46; Re 1:13.","refs":[["Luke",20,46,20,46],["Rev",1,13,1,13]]},{"text":"Girt up during employment — Lu 17:8; Joh 13:4.","refs":[["Luke",17,8,17,8],["John",13,4,13,4]]},{"text":"Hyke or upper garment. — De 24:13; Mt 21:8.","refs":[["Deut",24,13,24,13],["Matt",21,8,21,8]]},{"text":"Burnouse or cloak. — Lu 6:29; 2Ti 4:13.","refs":[["Luke",6,29,6,29],["2Tim",4,13,4,13]]},{"text":"Tunic or coat. — Joh 19:23; 21:7.","refs":[["John",19,23,19,23],["John",21,7,21,7]]},{"text":"Girdle. — 1Sa 18:4; Ac 21:11.","refs":[["1Sam",18,4,18,4],["Acts",21,11,21,11]]},{"text":"Bonnet or hat. — Le 8:13; Da 3:21.","refs":[["Lev",8,13,8,13],["Dan",3,21,3,21]]},{"text":"Shoe or sandal. — Ex 3:5; Mr 6:9.","refs":[["Exod",3,5,3,5],["Mark",6,9,6,9]]},{"text":"Vail. — Ge 24:65.","refs":[["Gen",24,65,24,65]]},{"text":"Liable to plague and leprosy — Le 13:47-59.","refs":[["Lev",13,47,13,59]]},{"text":"Cleansed by water from ceremonial uncleanness — Le 11:32; Nu 31:20.","refs":[["Lev",11,32,11,32],["Num",31,20,31,20]]},{"text":"Of the finest materials. — Mt 11:8.","refs":[["Matt",11,8,11,8]]},{"text":"Gay. — Jas 2:23.","refs":[["Jas",2,23,2,23]]},{"text":"Gorgeous. — Lu 7:25; Ac 12:21.","refs":[["Luke",7,25,7,25],["Acts",12,21,12,21]]},{"text":"Embroidered. — Ps 45:14; Eze 16:18.","refs":[["Ps",45,14,45,14],["Ezek",16,18,16,18]]},{"text":"Perfumed. — Ps 45:8; Song 4:11.","refs":[["Ps",45,8,45,8],["Song",4,11,4,11]]},{"text":"Multiplied and heaped up. — Job 27:17; Isa 3:22.","refs":[["Job",27,17,27,17],["Isa",3,22,3,22]]},{"text":"Often moth-eaten. — Job 13:28; Jas 5:2.","refs":[["Job",13,28,13,28],["Jas",5,2,5,2]]},{"text":"Provided specially by God. — De 10:18.","refs":[["Deut",10,18,10,18]]},{"text":"Vile. — Jas 2:2.","refs":[["Jas",2,2,2,2]]},{"text":"Used as a covering by night. — De 24:13.","refs":[["Deut",24,13,24,13]]},{"text":"Not to be retained in pledge. — De 24:12,13.","refs":[["Deut",24,12,24,12],["Deut",24,13,24,13]]},{"text":"Grew old and wore out — Jos 9:5; Ps 102:26.","refs":[["Josh",9,5,9,5],["Ps",102,26,102,26]]},{"text":"Of Israel preserved for forty years — De 8:4.","refs":[["Deut",8,4,8,4]]},{"text":"Were often changed — Ge 35:2; 41:14.","refs":[["Gen",35,2,35,2],["Gen",41,14,41,14]]},{"text":"Of those slain with a sword not used — Isa 14:19.","refs":[["Isa",14,19,14,19]]},{"text":"Given as a token of covenants — 1Sa 18:4.","refs":[["1Sam",18,4,18,4]]},{"text":"Given as presents — Ge 45:22; 2Ki 5:22.","refs":[["Gen",45,22,45,22],["2Kgs",5,22,5,22]]},{"text":"Often rent in affliction — 2Sa 15:32; Ezr 9:3,5.","refs":[["2Sam",15,32,15,32],["Ezra",9,3,9,3],["Ezra",9,5,9,5]]},{"text":"(White,) of righteousness. — Mt 28:3; Re 3:18.","refs":[["Matt",28,3,28,3],["Rev",3,18,3,18]]},{"text":"(Rolled in blood,) of victory. — Isa 9:5.","refs":[["Isa",9,5,9,5]]},{"text":"(Washed in wine,) of abundance. — Ge 49:11.","refs":[["Gen",49,11,49,11]]}],"refCount":85}
